{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284190","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028419001:0":{"text":"테오도르가 두 식물학자를 이 길목까지 배웅했다고 했어.","source_cn":"西奥多说他把两位植物学家送到了这个路口，才和他们分开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFCD471D0DA3876B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028419002:1":{"text":"이상하네요. 전에 채집대를 찾을 때 타란 마을로 향하는 발자국을 보지 못했어요.","source_cn":"奇怪，之前找采集队的时候，满满没看到有足迹往塔兰村去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA664F7DF8872B5FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028419003:1":{"text":"길에 발자국이 많아서 잘못 본 거 아냐?","source_cn":"明明路上有很多足迹，你是不是看错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BB6C265A9ACF7E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028419004:1":{"text":"치피가 잘못 볼 리 없어! 치피는 방향을 아주 잘 구분한단 말이야!","source_cn":"满满才不会看错呢！方向满满还是能认清楚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE795A2A84B106DBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028419005:2":{"text":"... 두 식물학자가 정말로 길을 잃어서 더 먼 갈림길로 돌아서 간 거 아닐까?","source_cn":"……难道那两位植物学家难道真走错了路，跑到更远的岔路上了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27922DCDCBEF9186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028419006:1":{"text":"현지인이 그렇게 길을 잃는다구요? 현지인이 아닌 치피도 타란 마을로 가는 길을 기억하는걸요?","source_cn":"这样都能迷路，他们还是不是本地人？连满满都还记得回塔兰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF23D36F14F7E46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028419007:1":{"text":"... 치피 말이 맞아. 와일더스 식물학자라면 매일 같이 숲에 있을 텐데, 익숙한 곳에서 길을 잃는다는 게 말이 안 돼.","source_cn":"……满满说的其实有些道理，绿裔的植物学者常年泡在森林里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF253A37532DA8078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028419008:1":{"text":"그래도 우선은 얼른 찾아보자.","source_cn":"不过，我们还是先去找人吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D841D9A645BB300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}